=== A. 实时迁移核心机制：内存状态序列化与恢复（suspend -> save -> restore） ===


$ define /tmp/xs-lab-vm.xml
Domain 'xs-lab-vm' defined from /tmp/xs-lab-vm.xml

$ start xs-lab-vm
Domain 'xs-lab-vm' started

$ domstate xs-lab-vm
running

$ save xs-lab-vm /tmp/xs-lab-vm.save

Domain 'xs-lab-vm' saved to /tmp/xs-lab-vm.save

$ list --all
 Id   Name        State
----------------------------
 1    test        running
 -    xs-lab-vm   shut off

$ restore /tmp/xs-lab-vm.save
Domain restored from /tmp/xs-lab-vm.save

$ domstate xs-lab-vm
running

$ list --all
 Id   Name        State
---------------------------
 1    test        running
 3    xs-lab-vm   running


=== B. 基于快照的备份与导出（= 快照一致点 + 导出 xva） ===
[1] 在 base.qcow2 建立一致性备份点 backup-point
  Snapshot list:
  ID      TAG               VM_SIZE                DATE        VM_CLOCK     ICOUNT
  1       before-change         0 B 2026-11-16 11:44:53  0000:00:00.000          0
  2       after-change          0 B 2026-11-16 11:44:53  0000:00:00.000          0
  3       backup-point          0 B 2026-11-16 11:44:54  0000:00:00.000          0
